{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NCLKvxoTHju765UCphD5jU","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-13\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| phase2_3method_selfit | RGDS diversity selection 能减缓 self-iterate 模式下的多样性崩塌（rare n-gram 丢失），表现优于 uncurated baseline，至少与 external_only 持平 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- phase2_ext_seed123: external_only seed=123 复现实验，验证 Phase 2 external_only 结果的可重复性（N>1 统计检验准备）（已分配 ? GPU:?，等待提交）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **phase1b_self_iterate** (success): 固定 generator 阻断 feedback loop 是前两次实验未崩塌的根因。Student-as-generator 自迭代模式（GPT2-125M 8 代）应能诱导可测量的 model collapse（RankMe >20% 下降，PPL 恶化） ← 基于 phase1_gpt2_collapse\\\\n- **phase1_gpt2_collapse** (negative): —\\\\n- **mvp_serial_v4** (negative): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 2 / 失败 3 / 共 9\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-11235: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rgds_v1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ext_v1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rgds_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ext_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rgds_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_serial_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 981, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nh5RBKXWYS5GCWfUn3wnYy","session_id":"2df59a54-ef24-4a14-a88b-11610600ad72","uuid":"72b537d9-8293-45ca-978a-fb0dde11f7bb","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:04:04.690Z"}
