{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JGSchSrzVWzqLW2vumLrdi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全可用。标题保留 \"Alignment Gap\" + \"Accelerates Collapse\"。\n2\t\n3\t  plan_001 提供锚定数据：C1 用 selection ratio 单调下降曲线 (1.04→0.52) 做主图；\n4\t\n5\t  C3 用 RGDS vs uncurated 的 PPL/rare 分叉做第二主图；\n6\t\n7\t  C2-weak 通过 external_only 对照自然呈现 (ratio >1.2, PPL 优于 uncurated, rare ≈ uncurated)。\n8\t\n9\t  plan_004/005 提供 3-seed 统计，CI 不跨零，挡住 R3 (N=1) 攻击。\n10\t\n11\t  plan_006/007 提供 GPT2-medium 结果，挡住 R1 (scale) 攻击。\n12\t\n13\t  plan_008 re-anchoring 作为 §6 缓解实验，rare 改善 ~33%，升级为 \"found + partial fix\"。\n14\t\n15\t  plan_009 OpenWebText 挡住 R2 (dataset 单一性) 攻击。\n16\t\n17\t  可投 main conference 8 页，审稿人主攻面缩小到 scale（仍在 GPT2 家族内）和缓解方案的简单性。\n18\t\n19\t  '\n20\timagined_experiments:\n21\t- name: Phase 2 三方法对比 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103, seed=42)\n22\t  plan_id: plan_001\n23\t  description: Self-iterate GPT2-125M × 8 gens × 3 methods (uncurated/RGDS/external_only)。锚定全部\n24\t    claims 的主实验。\n25\t  expected_results:\n26\t    rgds:\n27\t      gen0:\n28\t        ppl: 37.2\n29\t        sel_ratio: 1.04\n30\t        rare: 0.0288\n31\t        rank_corr: -0.058\n32\t        rankme: 281.5\n33\t        knn: 0.988\n34\t      gen1:\n35\t        ppl: 42.5\n36\t        sel_ratio: 0.96\n37\t        rare: 0.0208\n38\t        rank_corr: -0.074\n39\t        rankme: 290.2\n40\t        knn: 0.988\n41\t      gen2:\n42\t        ppl: 49.8\n43\t        sel_ratio: 0.87\n44\t        rare: 0.0152\n45\t        rank_corr: -0.089\n46\t        rankme: 296.4\n47\t        knn: 0.987\n48\t      gen3:\n49\t        ppl: 56.3\n50\t        sel_ratio: 0.79\n51\t        rare: 0.0113\n52\t        rank_corr: -0.103\n53\t        rankme: 300.1\n54\t        knn: 0.988\n55\t      gen4:\n56\t        ppl: 61.7\n57\t        sel_ratio: 0.71\n58\t        rare: 0.0086\n59\t        rank_corr: -0.118\n60\t        rankme: 303.2\n61\t        knn: 0.988\n62\t      gen5:\n63\t        ppl: 66.4\